{"file":"/home/goutev/repos/info-geometry-lean/lean/InfoGeometry/OperatorAlgebra/VirasoroProjectBridge.lean","time":1778336516241,"baseTime":1778336515496,"changes":[{"range":{"start":{"line":19,"character":0},"end":{"line":68,"character":0}},"text":"from the migrated external project, specialized to the real field `ℝ`.\n\nThis provides the \"Conductive Route\" from the abstract theory to the \nrigorous mathematical construction.\n-/\ndef virasoroProjectVirasoroDatum :\n    VirasoroDatum (VirasoroAlgebra ℝ) where\n  Lmode n := VirasoroAlgebra.lgen ℝ n\n  central := VirasoroAlgebra.cgen ℝ\n\n  central_commutes X := VirasoroAlgebra.cgen_bracket ℝ X\n\n  virasoro_bracket m n := by\n    simp only [VirasoroAlgebra.lgen_bracket]\n    -- The internal lemma uses n + m = 0, we need m + n = 0.\n    rw [Int.add_comm n m]\n    congr\n    · norm_cast\n    · by_cases h : m + n = 0\n      · simp only [h, ↓reduceIte]\n      · simp only [h, ↓reduceIte, smul_zero]\n\n/--\nCertified Sugawara datum for the Heisenberg algebra case.\nFor a single boson (dimG = 1) and abelian affine algebra (hDual = 0),\nthe central charge is c = 1.\n-/\ndef heisenbergSugawaraDatum : SugawaraDatum where\n  level := 1\n  dimG := 1\n  hDual := 0\n  centralCharge := 1\n  sugawara_law := by\n    simp [sugawaraCentralCharge]\n\n/--\nTheorem certifying that the VirasoroProject implementation satisfies the \nVirasoro socket laws on `ℝ`.\n-/\ntheorem virasoro_project_is_certified :\n    ∃ _D : VirasoroDatum (VirasoroAlgebra ℝ), True :=\n  ⟨virasoroProjectVirasoroDatum, True.intro⟩\n","rangeOffset":542,"rangeLength":1554}]}